5:["$","main",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingBlock":32},"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CreativeWork\",\"name\":\"ミュージカル『刀剣乱舞』 鶴丸国永 大倶利伽羅 双騎出陣 〜春風桃李巵〜\",\"description\":\"ミュージカル本公演から派生し、少数の刀剣男士で多彩な物語を展開するシリーズの最新作。本作では、伊達家伝来で旧知の仲である鶴丸国永と大倶利伽羅の二振りが「双騎出陣」を果たす。1部では伊達に縁のある彼らの深い関係性や秘められた物語を重厚なミュージカルパートとして描き、2部では一転してお馴染みの熱いライブパートを展開。飄々とした鶴丸国永と、馴れ合うことを嫌う孤高の大倶利伽羅。対照的でありながらも強い絆で結ばれた二振りの魅力が炸裂し、客席を熱狂の渦に巻き込んだ至高のバディ公演。\",\"url\":\"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-musical-tsurumaru-ookurikara-souki-2022\",\"keywords\":\"ライブ感強め, スタイリッシュ, 和風モチーフ, エモい\",\"about\":\"ミュージカル『刀剣乱舞』（刀ミュ）\",\"actor\":[]}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"stack-lg","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"hero-card stack-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Play Detail SSR"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"page-title","children":"ミュージカル『刀剣乱舞』 鶴丸国永 大倶利伽羅 双騎出陣 〜春風桃李巵〜"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"lead","children":"ミュージカル本公演から派生し、少数の刀剣男士で多彩な物語を展開するシリーズの最新作。本作では、伊達家伝来で旧知の仲である鶴丸国永と大倶利伽羅の二振りが「双騎出陣」を果たす。1部では伊達に縁のある彼らの深い関係性や秘められた物語を重厚なミュージカルパートとして描き、2部では一転してお馴染みの熱いライブパートを展開。飄々とした鶴丸国永と、馴れ合うことを嫌う孤高の大倶利伽羅。対照的でありながらも強い絆で結ばれた二振りの魅力が炸裂し、客席を熱狂の渦に巻き込んだ至高のバディ公演。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pill-row","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"pill","href":"/series/touken-ranbu-musical","children":["シリーズ: ","ミュージカル『刀剣乱舞』（刀ミュ）"]}],[["$","span","ライブ感強め",{"className":"pill","children":["#","ライブ感強め"]}],["$","span","スタイリッシュ",{"className":"pill","children":["#","スタイリッシュ"]}],["$","span","和風モチーフ",{"className":"pill","children":["#","和風モチーフ"]}],["$","span","エモい",{"className":"pill","children":["#","エモい"]}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"pill","children":"配信情報あり"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-2","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"section-card stack-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","children":"公演情報"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-list","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-item","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-label","children":"主な出演者"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-value","children":"未登録"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-item","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-label","children":"期間"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-value","children":"東京: 2022/08/07-08/14 / 大阪: 2022/08/20-09/04"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-item","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-label","children":"劇場"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-value","children":"天王洲 銀河劇場 / サンケイホールブリーゼ"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section-card stack-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","children":"視聴と回遊"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"link-list","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"inline-link","href":"https://al.dmm.com/?lurl=https://tv.dmm.com/vod/detail/?season=btwt6usc2s8tmfa36crt18krg&af_id=stageconnect-001&ch=dmmtv_share&ch_id=link","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"DMM TV で見る"}],null,null,["$","$L2",null,{"className":"inline-link","href":"/plays","children":"作品一覧へ戻る"}],["$","$L2",null,{"className":"inline-link","href":"/actors","children":"俳優一覧を見る"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section-card stack-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","children":"クレジット"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-list","children":[["$","div","原案-「刀剣乱舞-ONLINE-」より (DMM GAMES/NITRO PLUS)",{"className":"meta-item","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-label","children":"原案"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-value","children":"「刀剣乱舞-ONLINE-」より (DMM GAMES/NITRO PLUS)"}]]}],["$","div","演出-茅野イサム",{"className":"meta-item","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-label","children":"演出"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-value","children":"茅野イサム"}]]}],["$","div","脚本-浅井さやか、白川ユキ、月森 葵",{"className":"meta-item","chi